# Always commit and push

When gallery, content, or code work for this site is finished and verified (build OK when substantial):

1. Commit the relevant files (do not wait to be asked).
2. Push to `main` so GitHub Pages deploys:

```powershell
cd "d:\Sandbox\Paint web site 2.0"
git push origin main
```

3. Share the live URL: https://valentynpi.github.io/pidlypna-art/

Follow the project's git safety protocol (no force push, no amend of pushed commits, no secrets). Do not deploy to Vercel.
